 "summary": "Eight single Schottky rectifiers in the two-terminal DO-214AB (SMC) surface-mount package, each rated 10 A average forward current and 175 A for one 8.3 ms half-sine surge, with peak reverse voltage from 20 V (SK102C) to 200 V (SK1020C). Maximum forward voltage at 10 A rises with the voltage grade, from 0.55 V to 0.95 V. Named uses are low-voltage high-frequency inverters, freewheeling, DC/DC converters and polarity protection. SK1010C is the 100 V grade.",
